WEBVTT

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:36.110
Can you imagine...

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:41.450
...a life in which you could
never touch the one you love?

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:44.290
He takes the life of whatever he touches.

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:47.750
That was the curse the witch put on him.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:52.090
Plants, animals... and people
are no exception, of course.

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:55.470
Regarding her son, doomed to live his life
without knowing the warmth of another,

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:58.140
his mother only complained.

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.640
"That child is like Death incarnate..."

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:01.720
she said.

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:10.520
The outfit you have on today
looks very nice on you, Your Grace.

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:13.740
I love the way you
compliment me every day...

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:17.360
Alice, don't you get sick of wearing
that maid uniform day after day?

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:19.530
Shall I supply you with some new ones?

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:22.040
Well, actually, I change every day.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:26.040
--You do?
--Sometimes it's skimpy, sometimes
it's lace, sometimes it's frilly...

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.370
Would you care to have a look?

00:01:27.370 --> 00:01:29.710
I wasn't talking about your underwear...

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:31.090
And besides,
you're already showing it off!

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:04.050
"Episode 5: The Duke,
a Crow, and Ice Skating"

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:04.050
Yoo-hoo!

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.060
"Episode 5: The Duke,
a Crow, and Ice Skating"

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.060
Dearest Brother!

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:08.810
The extraordinarily cute
Little Miss Viola...

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:11.270
...has deigned to pay you a vi-zit?!

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:14.520
R-R-R-R-Rob, um, uh, h-how dew ya dew?

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:17.440
How long has it been, Lady Viola?

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:18.740
Um, uh...

00:03:18.740 --> 00:03:20.950
She's always super nervous around him...

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:24.320
I shall bring you some tea now.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:25.910
Th-Th-Th-Thank you!

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:29.250
I-I'm fine with rainwater or whatever,
so please don't go out of your way for me!

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.920
Oh, he's looking
totally dreamy again today...

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.250
I simply adore you, Rob...

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.880
--You're such a panther.
--Oh, be quiet.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:38.170
I am not a panther.

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:41.090
It's just that the guy I've fallen for
happens to be much, much older than me.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:44.340
Isn't that what society calls a "panther"?

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:45.260
Whatever.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:49.220
Boys my age act so childish,
I'll have nothing to do with them.

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:51.520
But Rob's a servant...

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.270
You're one to talk!

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:56.520
Is something the matter?

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:58.320
Oh, sweets!

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:01.900
I also brought you the tea
that Rob made for you.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:08.540
Mmm! This is great!

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:13.420
Come to think of it,
I wonder what kind of girl Alice is...

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:16.080
I'd better see for myself.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:20.090
While I enjoy the sweets
you make, Alice...

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:23.130
...I find there's something
lacking in you as a maid.

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:33.560
And that is, you've got
virtually no charm!

00:04:33.560 --> 00:04:37.940
While you may have a somewhat
pretty face and huge boobs...

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:40.110
Do you mind if I give them
a little squeeze?

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:41.490
Be my guest.

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:46.370
Darn, they're soft...

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:48.370
But I digress...

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:51.080
You're a bit lacking in
the human appeal department.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:55.750
I'll teach you what charm is
using the Viola Method. Okay?

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:58.250
What the heck is she doing?
It makes me jealous.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.470
The Viola Method Charm School!

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:06.800
"How to Make a Cute Face, Pt. 1."

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:10.010
Blend into the wall,
Dearest Brother, and don't move!

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:11.680
Okay, okay...

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:13.810
When it comes to charm,
it's all in the face!

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:17.810
In a nutshell, all you've
got to do is play the cutesy girl.

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:21.980
With women it goes down like
a lead balloon, but it's loads of charm.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:24.360
Well? Think you can do it, Alice?

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:26.320
I wonder how she'll react.

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:29.830
A cool girl would probably
object to doing this.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:33.160
You look awfully charming, Lady Viola.

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:35.500
Please do teach me as well.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.170
You're such a good girl!

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:40.590
--Okay, I'll make
an exception in your case.
--My sister's so gullible.

00:05:40.590 --> 00:05:41.920
Make a duck face!

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.420
Tilt your head slightly to one side!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.090
Hide the contours of your face
with your hands!

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:46.590
Look upwards!

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:48.840
Hey, you're forgetting
to make a duck face!

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:51.260
How much longer are they
going to keep this up?

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:53.810
Dearest Brother,
you can turn and face us now.

00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:54.640
Oh?

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:55.890
How's this?

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:56.940
I'm all choked up!

00:05:56.940 --> 00:06:00.110
You look so cute I want to buy you
everything your heart desires!

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:03.150
I owe it all to Lady Viola's training.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:06.320
Well, you've still got
a long way to go to reach my level.

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:09.990
Am I oozing charm, Your Grace?

00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:14.290
What's with the raunchy remix
just for my sake?!

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.660
Forgive the intrusion.

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:19.830
Lady Viola, your butlers say it's
almost time for you to head home.

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:21.380
Really?

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:24.630
I wasn't able to talk
with Rob again today...

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:27.260
Hey, Viola. Why don't you say
goodbye to Rob...

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:29.550
...using the Viola Method?

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:30.970
You've got a point there.

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:33.970
I'll show you guys what real charm is!

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:38.140
You've got to put on your cutest face
in front of the one you love!

00:06:38.140 --> 00:06:40.810
Rob, I'll come see you again sometime.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:45.280
Rob, I'll come see you again sum-thyme...

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:48.860
Apparently, there's a gap between
a person's ideals and reality.

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:57.330
I wonder when Lady Viola
will come here again.

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.120
Beats me.

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:03.500
I wonder if Alice
has taken a shine to her.

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:13.510
Yoo-hoo! Dearest Bruh-thuh?!

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:16.470
Why, if it isn't Lady Viola!

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:20.730
--R-R-R-Rob?
--How good of you to drop by!

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:24.060
If you're looking for His Grace,
he's in the kitchen.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.440
Oh, okay.

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:28.740
I didn't really come here
to see my brother or anything...

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:31.700
Oh, Rob, you're looking like
a total dreamboat again today...

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:34.530
I'd only like you to taste the soup stock.

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:36.490
You're just saying that
so you can take a peek, right?

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:37.700
Huh?

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:40.660
Okay then, promise me you won't
take a peek inside my mouth.

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:43.460
It's really embarrassing when you stare.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:45.170
All right, now...

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:48.670
What are you guys doing?

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:49.970
V-V-Viola?!

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.590
I-I can explain this.

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:54.340
I thought the witch would be attracted
by the smell and come back again.

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.260
Right, Alice?

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:59.020
Yes, I was just getting ready
to make some bread and stew.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:01.060
Oh, a witch, huh?

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:03.310
As if I really care about that...

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:06.820
This may be a chance to show Rob
just how girlish I am!

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:10.940
Let me help out with the cooking, too!

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:13.070
Of course, milady.

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:15.200
They've really hit it off well.

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:18.540
It's not too tight, is it?

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:20.120
No, it's fine.

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:23.710
This is the first time
I've worn one of these.

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:26.290
It looks adorable on you.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:29.090
Okay then, why don't you
shape the bread dough?

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:30.630
Just you and Rob!

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:34.340
Good luck, Viola!

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:35.640
You're so creepy!

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:41.480
All right, then.

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:45.560
I've finally got a chance
to have a leisurely chat with Rob.

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:47.860
I'm so freaking nervous!

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:57.990
Oh, how cute! It looks like he's really
having fun rolling the dough into balls!

00:08:57.990 --> 00:09:03.460
--I hope I come back as bread
dough in the next life.
--All right then, how shall we
shape the dough?

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:07.420
Well, um, I'm not sure because
I've never made bread before.

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:10.050
Why don't you decide, Rob?

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:13.170
There isn't a man alive who hates it
when a girl depends on him.

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:14.970
That's the Viola Method.

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:20.930
Well then, how about something like this?

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:24.480
That's really fancy!

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:26.230
Pretty cute, don't you think?

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:28.360
You're the one that's pretty cute!

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:34.240
Milady, why don't you try shaping
the dough into whatever form you wish?

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:38.160
I don't know why,
but when I'm cooking with you like this...

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:40.990
...it feels like we're newlyweds.

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:42.160
--Don't you think so, Rob?
--Your Grace?

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:43.620
--Don't you think so, Rob?
--No, it's nothing!

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:48.920
Not at all. You're much too young
to be my wife, Lady Viola.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.210
"Wife," he said!

00:09:51.210 --> 00:09:52.920
Although if I weren't a butler,

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:56.010
I might have had a granddaughter
about your age, milady.

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.220
"Granddaughter," he said!

00:09:57.220 --> 00:09:59.600
Aren't you going to make any more bread?

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:01.100
"Bread," he said!

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.180
Uh, bread. Right.

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:15.940
I'm so jealous of my brother.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:20.070
He's got you and Alice by his side,
and he seems to be having fun.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:27.870
With his curse and all, I'm glad that he's
got people to give him emotional support.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:29.630
Still,

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:33.500
you'd better tell that idiot to quit
goofing around or his younger brother...

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.670
...will take his place
as head of the family.

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:39.090
Thank you, milady.

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:41.890
You may say otherwise,

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:45.970
but deep down,
you truly do care about His Grace.

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:47.310
Oh, Rob!

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.890
Wow, that's some bread!

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:50.850
It looks really cute.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.980
You're such a creep! Like, seriously,
don't even talk to me!

00:10:52.980 --> 00:10:55.030
Oh? S-Sorry...

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:06.620
I wish I could've been with Rob
for longer than that...

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:08.120
Lady Viola!

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:10.500
Rob!

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:12.920
Oh! Um...

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:14.210
Please, take these.

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:16.260
They're fresh from the oven.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:17.510
Oh...

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:20.300
Please come back anytime.

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:24.140
Um, okay. Thanks!

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:37.990
Mmm!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:56.630
Your Grace, are you watching me?

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:58.590
Yeah, I'm watching you!

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:00.510
Would you like to see more?

00:12:00.510 --> 00:12:02.130
More of what?!

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:10.230
She's so cute...

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:12.100
Yeah, she's seriously cute.

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:13.440
Huh?

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:19.320
Hey, you haven't seen anybody
lost around here, have you?

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:20.490
What?

00:12:21.610 --> 00:12:24.410
I don't know if it's because
I fell and hit my head,

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:26.830
but it sounds like this crow's
speaking to me.

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:30.330
Hey, I'm picking up some
magical energy coming from you.

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:31.910
Aren't you one of us?

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:32.710
Huh?

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:35.880
W-Well, I'm cursed, so that might be why.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.340
Oh, so you're just a human, huh?

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:40.960
So, you're a magic user, then?

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:42.670
That's right.

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:45.800
You wouldn't happen to be looking for...

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:47.760
...a lost, red-haired girl, would you?

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:51.640
Yeah, a chick with a serious look on
her face and not a thought in her head.

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:52.560
Uh...

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:55.060
...so, you're the childhood friend
that Cuff was talking about.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:58.020
What? You mean she told you about me?

00:12:58.020 --> 00:12:59.270
That's not like her.

00:12:59.270 --> 00:13:02.530
It's not in her nature
to trust anyone but me.

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:04.700
So, do you know where she went?

00:13:04.700 --> 00:13:09.660
Beats me. She left suddenly,
and I haven't seen her since.

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:11.120
I see.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:16.500
Uh, haven't you been staring
at Alice a tad too much?

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.420
Heh-heh, so you noticed.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:22.130
Your Grace, I found something
surprising out on the lake.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:24.220
I met someone surprising myself just now.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:26.760
Cuff's friend... Whoa?!

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:29.850
My name's Zain. I'm a magic user.

00:13:29.850 --> 00:13:31.600
Nice to meet you, Alice!

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:32.980
Nice to meet you, too.

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:35.060
His attitude is unmistakably
different around her!

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:37.650
Alice, I think you're majorly cute.

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.360
Wha--?!

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:40.440
You've got a gorgeous face
and a voice to match.

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:41.190
Whoa?!

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:42.570
You're too close!

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:44.030
What is with you, anyway?

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:46.450
She's my Alice. Stop hitting on her!

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:48.530
I'm crazy about girls,

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:51.030
so asking me to stop
hitting on them is asking too much.

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:52.740
You know why?
'Cause I'm crazy about girls.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.290
You don't have to say that twice now!

00:13:55.290 --> 00:14:00.540
Girls put makeup on and dress up
for the guys they're into, right?

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.460
Your point being?

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:04.460
I find that behavior
so adorable. I just love it.

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:07.470
But when I mention that
to Cuff, she's like...

00:14:07.470 --> 00:14:09.760
What's the point of flirting with guys?

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:11.510
She is such a letdown!

00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:14.770
Looks like he's got a real
fixation about something.

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:16.940
Oh, and...

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:20.190
...I've got a thing for boobs.

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:21.900
Those are your true colors showing!

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:23.940
What? Boobs are the bomb, right?

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:25.860
What are you playing the man's man for?

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.450
I'm not!

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:31.330
And besides, I'm more of
a thigh guy myself.

00:14:31.330 --> 00:14:32.990
Would you stop taking notes?!

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:36.160
Now, where the heck could Cuff have gone?

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:39.120
Can't you use your magic to find her?

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:41.960
No way, man. Magic can't solve everything.

00:14:41.960 --> 00:14:44.960
Anyhow, I'd better meet up with her soon.

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:47.300
She can't do anything on her own,

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.220
so I've got to protect her.

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.100
No, don't!

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:53.640
You mustn't squirm around like that.

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:56.890
Cuff?!

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:58.140
Cuff?

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:00.560
She'd fallen in the lake.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:04.190
She was freezing, so I thought
I'd warm her with my body heat.

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:05.860
Consider where you're putting her!

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.860
And you, stop staring so much!

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:16.250
That's the first time someone's
wedged me between their breasts.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:17.700
Oh, Zain, it's you.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:19.120
I was looking all over for you.

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:20.420
Same here!

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:21.880
I'd about given you up for dead!

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.210
How many times did I tell you
not to go anywhere if we got separated?

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:25.380
I forgot about that.

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:27.380
What does it matter? I survived, didn't I?

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:28.670
Now look here...

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:30.680
Isn't it great they found
each other safe and sound?

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:31.340
Yeah.

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:34.640
So, what were you guys doing here?

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:36.470
Oh, ice skating.

00:15:36.470 --> 00:15:37.980
Ice skating?

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:50.570
I'm telling you, Zain, don't move!

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:53.490
What do humans find so fun about this?

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:55.080
So, why don't you
just call it quits, then?

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:56.240
I am not a quitter!

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.290
See how stubborn you are already?

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:01.120
Cuff, why don't you
follow Alice's example?

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:04.290
Just look at how graceful
and ladylike she appears.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:06.210
Can you appreciate such virtue?

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:08.050
I doubt it.

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:11.930
You and she are total opposites.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:15.930
Darn that's hot!

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:18.390
Just be thankful you've got
natural ice to cool off with.

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:19.930
I'll tan your hide!

00:16:19.930 --> 00:16:22.310
It must be great to be
so physically close.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:24.350
Those two take it a bit too far, though...

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:26.190
--Your Grace?
--Huh?

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:29.400
Do you think you're about ready
to skate without any supports?

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:32.650
Just imagine flinging yourself
into my arms.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:33.910
Like I can do that!

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:37.580
But you made it all the way here
from the lake shore, didn't you?

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:39.870
Ice skating is all about momentum.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:43.460
Hey, I'm beginning to feel
like I can pull this off.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:45.130
I think I'll try skating
to the lake shore.

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:47.250
Why, that's a wonderful idea.

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.840
Okay, here goes!

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:50.920
Whoops!

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.630
Your Grace!

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:54.840
Ah-haha, sure enough, I slipped.

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:56.890
But I actually skated there
for a little bit.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:59.100
This is fun!

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:01.520
I'm happy to hear you say that.

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:02.850
Yeah, thanks.

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:06.150
I owe it all to you.
You're too close, though.

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:09.020
It must be great to be
so true to your feelings.

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:11.570
Those two take it a bit too far, though...

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:17.320
Wh-What is it?

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:18.700
Just start walking.

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:19.790
Huh?

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:27.130
Oh, it's so much easier this way!

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.460
Skating's a lot of fun!

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:31.210
You can't really call this
skating anymore, can you?

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:32.550
Alice, come join us!

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:33.550
Certainly.

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:35.970
You too, Your Grace.

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:50.230
Oh!

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:51.570
It's snowing.

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:00.580
Thanks for today.

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:02.370
I'm glad we could meet.

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:04.910
Yeah, same here. We owe you one.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:07.670
I talked it over with Zain, and...

00:18:08.670 --> 00:18:12.210
...on the night of the next blood moon,
we're thinking of taking you

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:15.050
to a gathering of witches
called the witches' sabbath.

00:18:15.050 --> 00:18:16.380
Huh?

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:18.840
Since we can't tell you
anything about witches,

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:21.350
go to the witches' sabbath and do
some investigating of your own.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:23.390
We'll help you out
if something goes wrong.

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:26.520
Wait!

00:18:26.520 --> 00:18:28.900
You're telling me to plunge into
the witches' midst

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:31.650
and find the one that cursed me?

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:35.110
That's exactly what we're saying.

00:18:35.110 --> 00:18:37.490
We'll come for you the next time
the moon turns blood red.

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:39.450
You'd better be ready when we do.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:47.620
Are they serious?

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:49.830
May I come with you?

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:52.090
Huh? Well, I don't know...

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:55.920
Please? There's something
I'd like to make sure of.

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:59.970
You think you can win me over
if you say it all cutesy.

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:01.090
Please, Your Grace?

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:03.180
So, here you go and bust out
the Viola Method?!

00:19:09.060 --> 00:19:10.600
Yes, I'll be right there...

00:19:12.690 --> 00:19:14.650
Why, hello there, Alice...

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:16.940
Why are you standing there half-naked?!

00:19:16.940 --> 00:19:19.110
Lady Viola?

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:22.740
I really wanted to spend
the night in Rob's room,

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:25.080
but my brother wouldn't let me.

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:28.290
So, I decided I'd spend the night here.

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:29.670
I see.

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:32.290
Anyway, what a small room you have.

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:33.340
What's this?

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:37.550
Why do you have a dead flower
in a jar on your table?

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:39.840
It's one of my prized possessions.

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:43.430
You sure are strange, Alice.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:45.760
But I kind of like that about you.

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:47.560
Thank you.

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:52.860
You're so warm.

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.770
This feels like a girls only party.

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:55.770
A girls only party?

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:59.700
Yeah. We talk about stuff that we can
only discuss with other girls.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:03.410
For example, I don't think
you're aware of this, Alice...

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:08.450
...but you see, I've got a crush on Rob.

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:12.880
Oh, I didn't know.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:13.920
Shh!

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.590
It's our secret! You can't breathe
a word of this to anyone!

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:19.170
Rob is such a gentleman.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:22.220
I think he's the perfect match
for you, Lady Viola.

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:23.390
You get it?

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:26.100
I knew you would, Alice! See?
This is what a girls only party is like.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:27.930
So, this is a girls only party...

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:33.650
Do you have a crush on anyone, Alice?

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:34.900
Yes, I do.

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:38.110
He's like Prince Charming to me.

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:39.570
Prince Charming?

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:42.400
Aha, I knew it! My brother's
feelings for her go unreturned.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:43.860
The poor thing.

00:20:43.860 --> 00:20:46.450
He saved me when I needed it.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:48.790
He makes my life worthwhile.

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:49.950
Hey, Alice.

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:52.710
If you want to get this guy to like you,
come to me anytime for advice.

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:54.880
I'll coach you in the Viola Method.

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:57.920
That's so reassuring, Lady Viola.

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:04.760
I've always wanted an older sister.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:08.640
Ever since I was little, my mother focused
all of her attention on my brothers.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:10.930
I still put a lot of effort
into my lessons,

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:13.560
but she's never shown
any interest in me.

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:17.940
I've always wanted somebody
to pamper me like this.

00:21:22.820 --> 00:21:24.950
She looks just like His Grace
when she's asleep.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:26.700
Alice?

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:28.330
Is Viola here...

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:31.830
She's just fallen asleep.

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:34.460
Ooh, Viola's doing something else
that makes me jealous...

00:21:34.460 --> 00:21:35.540
Your Grace?

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:39.340
When Lady Viola wakes up tomorrow morning,
please compliment her as much as you can.

00:21:39.340 --> 00:21:40.590
Um, why?

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:43.670
I want her to feel pampered.

00:21:43.670 --> 00:21:45.510
Um, okay.

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:22.730
Alice, thanks for letting me
sleep over last night!

00:23:23.820 --> 00:23:26.990
So, what are you doing here,
Dearest Brother?

00:23:26.990 --> 00:23:28.110
Uh, well...

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:30.860
V-Viola, your hair
is so nice and beautiful.

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:32.780
See, mine's naturally curly, so... ahaha.

00:23:32.780 --> 00:23:35.450
Your point being? What are you
complimenting me for all of a sudden?

00:23:35.450 --> 00:23:38.500
Well, even if you had silky,
shiny hair, Dearest Brother,

00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:40.960
it wouldn't make you
any more popular with the ladies.

00:23:40.960 --> 00:23:42.670
And after I complimented her and all...

00:23:42.670 --> 00:23:46.420
Dearest Brother, I hope in the next life
you'll be more like Prince Charming.

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:49.170
You mustn't speak of that, Lady Viola.

00:23:49.170 --> 00:23:50.720
Oh, why not?

00:23:50.720 --> 00:23:52.180
He doesn't get it anyway.

00:23:52.180 --> 00:23:53.930
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:55.510
Something we talked about
at our girls only party.

00:23:55.510 --> 00:23:57.470
It's no concern of yours,
Dearest Brother.

00:23:57.470 --> 00:23:59.810
Well, let me join you next time, then.

00:23:59.810 --> 00:24:00.940
No can do.

00:24:00.940 --> 00:24:03.270
Hey, there's nothing wrong with it.

00:24:03.270 --> 00:24:04.440
Is there, Alice?

00:24:04.440 --> 00:24:05.900
Yes, there is.

00:24:06.730 --> 00:24:10.700
"The Duke, Alice, and a Night
in the Witches' World."
